{"id":"a762f9d6c343e3a0","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class.md","title":"ZFC Inner2 Definable Class","display":"df-zfc-inner2-definable-class — ZFC Inner2 Definable Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class"],"display":"df-zfc-inner2-definable-class — ZFC Inner2 Definable Class","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-class]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner2-definable-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner2-definable-class — ZFC Inner2 Definable Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\varphi,\\vec a,x\\in V\">\\(C,\\varphi,\\vec a,x\\in V\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 是类的集合编码而不是其真类外延</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (集合论语言公式码, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\)</span> (自由变元算子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{V,\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{V,\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\)</span> 是元语言类外延，不是集合值函数；在下式限定的类编码域上使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (schema defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\varphi,\\vec a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\vec a\\in V^n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n+1\\}\\bigr)\n\\land C=\\langle\\varphi,\\vec a\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\varphi,\\vec a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\vec a\\in V^n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n+1\\}\\bigr)\n\\land C=\\langle\\varphi,\\vec a\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class\\text{-}extension}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\varphi,\\vec a)\\to\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{V,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,x,\\vec a)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner2\\text{-}definable\\text{-}class\\text{-}extension}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{ZfcInner2DefinableClass}_S(C,\\varphi,\\vec a)\\to\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in\\operatorname{Ext}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{V,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,x,\\vec a)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{V,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,x,\\vec a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\vec a\\in V^n\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\bigl(V,\\varphi,\n\\{\\langle v_0,x\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},\\vec a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sat}_{V,\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,x,\\vec a)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\vec a\\in V^n\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;n+1\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\bigl(V,\\varphi,\n\\{\\langle v_0,x\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle v_{i+1},\\vec a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>编码中的第一个自由变元对应待判定的元素，其余有限个自由变元对应显式参数。允许不使用其中部分参数；不要求编码对同一外延唯一。</li>\n<li>外延与满意关系均为元语言模式，未假定存在集合论内部的全宇宙真谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元